@page "/about"

<MudContainer>
    <MudText Typo="Typo.h3" Class="mb-4">About Memory Game</MudText>
    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="mb-2">Project Information</MudText>
        <MudText>
            This is a simple memory game built with Blazor. The goal of the game is to match pairs of cards
            by flipping them over. It features different difficulty levels and keeps track of your scores.
        </MudText>
    </MudPaper>

    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="mb-2">Developer Information</MudText>
        <MudText>
            This project was developed by <MudLink Href="https://github.com/tejasveedighe" Target="_blank">Tejasvee
            Dighe</MudLink>. You can connect with the developer on
            <MudLink Href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/tejasveedighe/" Target="_blank">LinkedIn</MudLink>.
        </MudText>
    </MudPaper>

    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="mb-2">Project Challenge</MudText>
        <MudText>
            This project was inspired by a challenge from <MudLink
            Href="https://www.thecsharpacademy.com/project/40/memory-game" Target="_blank">Csharp Academy</MudLink>.
        </MudText>
    </MudPaper>

    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="mb-2">Image Credits</MudText>
        <MudText>
            The images used in this game are sourced from <MudLink Href="https://iconscout.com/" Target="_blank">Icon
            Scout</MudLink>.
        </MudText>
        <MudText>
            (Note: Please replace the placeholder text above with actual image sources and attributions once images are
            added to the project.)
        </MudText>
    </MudPaper>

    <MudPaper Class="pa-4 mb-4">
        <MudText Typo="Typo.h5" Class="mb-2">GitHub Repository</MudText>
        <MudText>
            You can find the source code for this project on
            <MudLink Href="https://github.com/tejasveedighe/MemoryGame" Target="_blank">GitHub</MudLink>.
        </MudText>
    </MudPaper>
</MudContainer>